    "title": "Matrix Block Sum",
    "category": "Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 M matrix of integers and an integer K, construct a matrix where each cell contains the sum of all elements within a distance of K rows and K columns from that cell.",
